[[File:S2E49 Psikofen plane.png|thumb|Psikofen singlehandedly tears apart the [[Huntik Foundation Jet]]]]
Psikofen's strength lies in its ability to use its chains as weapons, often targeting his enemies by the ankles so as to demobilize them before moving into finish them off; or even using them to pull away opponents' shields or defend itself against spells. The power Psikofen has in controlling these chains mean he is strong enough to single-handedly destroy a plane and can capture enemies as strong as [[Baselaird]]. It can also fire a laser from its forehead. Despite his strength, Psikofen lacks stamina, and will slow down as he gets tired from maneuvering his chains, something which [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Cherit]] exploited, sending it back to its [[Amulets|amulet]] with the latter's Energy Charge. Psikofen is also limited by only having one chain in each arm (one with a sphere at the end and the other one with a piercing diamond-shaped end), meaning that if it tries to ensnare two enemies at once without finishing them off, it will be left vulnerable. Its chains can be used against it if an opponent is able to grab them, making Psikofen trip. {{Source|Words from Eathon}}

